@startuml
[*] --> File Uploaded
File Uploaded --> Files Viewable : View Files
Files Viewable --> File Downloaded : Download File
Files Viewable --> Permissions Managed : Manage Permissions
Permissions Managed --> Access Control Set : Set Access Control
Access Control Set --> [*] : Revoke Access
Files Viewable --> Files Organized : Organize Files
Files Organized --> Files Searched : Search Files
Files Searched --> [*] : Return to Initial State
@enduml
